::  name       linengrow receipt field count
::  shape      fields - int (@u32)
::  invariant  a LinengrowReceipt carries exactly eleven fields (receipt_id -
::             product_id - purpose - recipient_id - offered_value -
::             value_unit - value_basis - promised_return - issued_at -
::             expires_at - status)
::  example    11
::  readers    Mantra - Glow Tend - Sur museum - Patchouli weave
::  nib        equinox-e208-mantra-tend-v0
::
::  Equinox e208 - Mantra M8 -- eighth Mantra structure pedestal in src/shape/.
::  Names LinengrowReceipt's field count from
::  mantra/src/linengrow_receipt_offer.rye, the receipt contract's holder-
::  readable projection (case 2): raw product bytes stay absent from every
::  field, and `from_snapshot` reports one of exactly two published statuses.
::  Pedestal only; Rye still owns the projection function and its own
::  comptime assert.
::
::  Eleven sits under rune_shape.max_fields (15); this pedestal does not
::  raise it.
+$  linengrow-receipt-field-count-shape
  $:  fields=@u32
  ==
